 "text": "COURTHOUSE - Washington County, Missouri\nPAY TAXES\nELECTION INFO\nTown Square & Amphitheater\nABOUT\nGOVERNMENT\nAirport\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nAssociate Circuit Court Judge\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Commissioners\nCommission Agenda’s\nCommission Mintues\nCounty Clerk\nEmergency Management\nIndustrial Development Authority\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nCOMMUNITY\n✕\nABOUT\nGOVERNMENT\nAirport\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nAssociate Circuit Court Judge\nCollector\nCoroner\nCounty Commissioners\nCommission Agenda’s\nCommission Mintues\nCounty Clerk\nEmergency Management\nIndustrial Development Authority\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nCOMMUNITY\nCOURTHOUSE\nWashington County Courthouse\nThe Washington County Courthouse in Potosi, Missouri is a historic government building completed in 1908 and designed in the Renaissance Revival style. For more than a century it has served as the center of county operations, housing the courts and many local government offices. As the place where much of Washington County’s official business is conducted, the courthouse remains both a functional civic hub and an enduring symbol of the county’s history and community pride.\nOFFICES & CONTACTS\nAirport\nAssessor\nCircuit Clerk\nAssociate Circuit Court Judge\nCollector\nCounty Commissioners\nCoroner\nCounty Clerk\nJuvenile Office\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nCOURTHOUSE\n102 North Missouri Street\nPotosi, MO 63664\n(573) 438-6111\nEmail Us\nPrivacy / SMS Texting Privacy\nAll site contents © 2026\nWashington County is an Equal Opportunity Employer.",
